Subject: [PATCH 08/27] ntfs3: use bdev_logical_block_size instead of open
 coding it
Date: Wed,  6 Apr 2022 08:04:57 +0200
Message-Id: <20220406060516.409838-9-hch@lst.de>
In-Reply-To: <20220406060516.409838-1-hch@lst.de>
